# Omega, Heartless Evolution (CR 603.6a, 601.2c, 122.1d, 119.3): when it enters, for each opponent, tap up to one target nonland
# permanent that opponent controls, put X stun counters on it and gain X life, X the number of nonbasic lands Bot1 controls.
# Bot1 has played a Forest (basic, not counted), a Tropical Island and an Underground Sea by turn 5, so X is 2: Bot2's Mox Ruby
# is tapped with two stun counters and Bot1 gains 2 (22). Bot2's Island is refused as a target (a land) and its Ornithopter,
# not chosen, is left alone.

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Tropical Island
Black Lotus
Mox Emerald
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Omega, Heartless Evolution
Underground Sea
Forest x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Island
Mox Ruby
Ornithopter
Island x17

